## countdfl
   - counts the number of snodes (directories, files, links) in a specifed directory.
   - good for checking if a job ran ok

## coundfiles
  - same as countdfl except it has separate counts for the directories files and links.

## runtime.py
   - parses a logfile (e.g. file in /lfs/h1/ops/prod/output/<yyyymmdd>)
   - prints the start, end, and run time for the job
